abstract: Analysis and benchmarking code, figure and table builders, and tracked results
  supporting the initial manuscript submission. IsoGraph resolves coordinated transcript
  usage alongside gene abundance in BrainSEQ and GTEx adult brain transcriptomes.
  Archive and preprint DOIs have not yet been assigned.
